sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Recruiter
    participant Drive as Shared Drive folder
    participant Sched as Cloud Scheduler
    participant API as talent-api
    participant DB as Cloud SQL
    participant LLM as Vertex AI Gemini

    Recruiter->>Drive: Upload or replace a résumé
    Sched->>API: POST /internal/drive/sync (OIDC token, every 5 min)
    API->>DB: Read saved page token
    API->>Drive: changes.list(pageToken, driveId)
    Drive-->>API: Changed files and a new page token
    loop Each changed file under the résumé folder
        API->>API: Folder rules: latest per person, skip offers and invoices
        API->>DB: Same Drive file id and md5 already stored?
        alt Unchanged
            API->>API: Skip, no download
        else New or edited
            API->>Drive: files.get alt=media (Google Docs: export PDF)
            API->>LLM: Read résumé into profile
            API->>API: FastEmbed vectors
            API->>DB: Upsert candidate, original_path = drive://fileId
        end
    end
    API->>DB: Save new page token
    Note over API,DB: A trashed or removed file marks the candidate inactive. The Drive file is never deleted.
